title Fold U -- hear_the_reader, and the absentee that stays home
prompt Autonomous loop -- Kyri voice and Radiant Style first, then REMEMBER and the itineraries, Standfast on reds, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, read one council-rota doc, sweep the prose Radiant, send the increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. Every living row in crux/REDS.md reads CLOSED -- %81, %83, %84, %98, %110 all carry their closure note and their witness. No agent-closable red stands open, so the constructive queue is free.
think Council rota, lap index 1511 mod 27 + 1 = 27 -- recursion-prompts/README.md. Its balance compass names the seven styles held together, and its one discipline reads straight onto a fold: witness before narrative, a lap that claims GREEN cites the witness or says honestly why it could not run. This lap the carry meter went RED before it went GREEN, and the RED was the honest half of the record.
think The running thread is the Caravan ladder fold arc. Fold T's recommend named hear_the_reader the better crux over provision_notes -- thirty-three rungs against twenty-four, provision_notes at ninety-one lines staying the body most likely to reach a rung's own wire. The carry meter run fresh agreed: 33 rungs x 54 lines = 1728 carried, second in the printed queue.
think Hash the family before folding it. Thirty-four files define hear_the_reader where the meter names thirty-three, and the thirty-fourth is caravan/hear.rye at forty lines against fifty-four. Reading both bodies rather than diffing their accessors showed this is fold R's FIRST kind of absentee -- genuinely dated by a shape born after it. hear.rye ends its run on a disagreeing hand with error.HearMisheard; every rung above records that disagreement as a non-agreement and carries on. Two texts, two meanings. It stays home, named in the harness for what it is.
think Fold T's lesson applied next: before widening a symbol, hash that symbol's own family. Only hearing_of was private across the thirty-three. Its thirty-three copies are each a different three-line text naming a different nesting depth, so it carries no family at all and widening it splits nothing. Every other symbol the body reaches -- eleven functions and four types -- already stood public, interest paid by the folds before this one.
think The carry meter pins its own numbers, so it went RED the moment the fold landed, which is the meter working. Repinned carried=122988 ceiling=123100 bodies=18065 distinct=7868, brought the scan's default ceiling 124700 -> 123100 in the same commit, and rotated the queue's second-named family from hear_the_reader to settle_the_plan so a later lap must come back and say so.
obs The arithmetic closes with no remainder both ways. The family gave back 1,728 -- thirty-two copies of fifty-four lines, the thirty-third being the distinct text -- and the three-line delegate family carries 96 across the same thirty-two, so the carry falls 1,632, exactly what the meter measured. Bodies climb by one and distinct texts by one, that one being the harness's own body.
obs The cheapest fold this arc has taken since fold P, and for the opposite reason. Fold P cost zero because a prior lap had widened its symbols; fold U costs thirty-three because its one private symbol is an accessor rather than a family. A fold's price is set by what the symbols it reaches already are, not by how many rungs it lifts out of.
obs A fold queue is still a lead rather than a verdict, four laps running. The count differed again -- thirty-four bodies against thirty-three rungs -- and the difference was worth reading rather than reconciling away.
